  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v11: Decoupled from HttpStatusCode via new ResultStatus enum, added Result.cs factory facade, RFC 9457 Problem Details support via ResultHandler.AspNetCore, custom JSON serialization. Old members (StatusMessage/StatusCode/ResultData) preserved as obsolete for backward compatibility. v11.1: Added Ensure/EnsureAsync guard-clause helpers, Result.Combine for aggregating independent checks (plus typed 2-4 arity tuple overloads), and Task-aware Match/OnSuccess/OnFailure/Map/Bind async composition helpers. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
